%% Compute invocation path: the dispatcher owns trigger state (capped), the process manager owns live processes.
flowchart LR
  subgraph Dispatch [Trigger dispatch]
    Dispatcher[TriggerDispatcher]
    Runs[Recent runs ≤10]
    StateStore[TriggerStateStore]
  end
  subgraph Sources [Trigger sources]
    TriggerObj[Trigger objects]
    FeedQ[Feed queue]
    Database[Database]
  end
  subgraph Runtime [Process runtime]
    PM[ProcessManager]
    Invoker[ProcessOpInvoker]
    HandlerSet[OpHandlerSet]
    LayerStack[LayerStack]
    ProcStore[ProcessStore KV]
    TraceSink[FeedTraceSink]
  end
  Ai[AiService]
  Dispatcher -->|owns, capped| Runs
  Dispatcher -->|change state| StateStore
  Dispatcher -->|live query| TriggerObj
  Dispatcher -->|cursor query| FeedQ
  Dispatcher -->|subscriptions| Database
  Dispatcher -->|spawn| PM
  PM --> Invoker
  Invoker -->|spawn child| PM
  Invoker -->|fromOperation| HandlerSet
  PM -->|resolve services| LayerStack
  PM -->|records| ProcStore
  PM -->|trace| TraceSink
  TraceSink -->|append| FeedQ
  LayerStack --> Ai
